  <section class="px-5 pt-24 md:px-10">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
      <h2 class="text-center text-[clamp(2.2rem,4.5vw,3.4rem)] leading-none text-forest">Good to know</h2>
      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-0">
        <div class="leading-relaxed text-ink/85 md:pr-10">
          <p class="font-display text-2xl text-forest">Where</p>
          <p class="mt-3">East Rock, Lighthouse Point, campus, the harbor, Wooster Square. If you have a place in mind, we'll make it work. If not, we'll suggest one that suits the season.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-gold leading-relaxed text-ink/85 md:border-l-2 md:px-10">
          <p class="font-display text-2xl text-forest">Travel</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Anywhere in Connecticut is always included. Rhode Island, Massachusetts, and greater New York are available for a small flat travel fee. Just ask.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-gold leading-relaxed text-ink/85 md:border-l-2 md:pl-10">
          <p class="font-display text-2xl text-forest">When</p>
          <p class="mt-3">The best light is the last 60–90 minutes before sunset, so that's when we usually shoot. We'll plan your session around it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
